{"id": "DfauqFmq2X-", "title": "Video by mythospaths", "description": "Her husband took their daughter to an altar to win a war... and she never saw her again. Ten years later, she rolled out a red carpet to welcome him home.\n\nThe Greek myth of Clytemnestra, the queen they called a monster: a girl who used to sing at her father's table, ten years of waiting, a chain of fires from Troy to her own roof, crimson cloth from the king's chariot to her door, and a door neither of them came back out of. Then the gods held a trial, and a mother lost. Retold as a paper-cutout film.\n\n#clytemnestra #greekmythology #agamemnon #mythology #mythospaths", "channel": "mythospaths", "uploader_id": "17131274983", "uploader": "mythospaths", "timestamp": 1794005867, "like_count": 1992, "comment_count": 27, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1117159814625108a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 49.407, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMPshk9rMcEIRo-qhiXmo_4JfiD1J644b-LwU5nYjL9JA8HpJDYzvzr3I940OyuVe48Ao49Gu4utgJMOcH78dkxF3YmfU3jX0emrhk.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adrbctnd-P8mZ00a5OeOC3YfHp7XIk4_t0ZBrIwRuj1_s8fmZyOipnMKIMZM1WihTtOpO0TpizqcUnoqriRJ-4rT&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=ax6Cn0Rq46EQ7kNvwHRtq_u&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=dozbeH8puSNi5VRjfz_jlA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSkKNMCSV_a1A8SSZu-R9yn3KvOZdagyXC8yyJvNyp1vw&oe=6AF43D13", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 49.407, "resoluti