0368605283", "id": "18360543559222246", "text": "Didn’t she also cheat on him with his cousin Aegisthus? They killed Agamemnon together", "timestamp": 1794039798, "like_count": 10}, {"author": "xgnerva_", "author_id": "77763097163", "id": "18080597750399733", "text": "Typical Athena behaviour!!! And she is godesses of wisdom. What a joke.", "timestamp": 1794039247, "like_count": 123}, {"author": "sammydurrani", "author_id": "831864793", "id": "18120381110059272", "text": "And due to the cruelty of the gods many stopped believing and took on a God they considered more loving…Jesus. 🤷🏻‍♀️", "timestamp": 1794037291, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "m0rdacious", "author_id": "1153811974", "id": "17933322108164435", "text": "The carpet was purple. Purple was the color that no one but the gods could use. There are some studies that suggest that it is a shade purple-crimson, however the evidence on the texts clearly state that the dominant color was purple.\n\nYes it is because of Clytemnestra that the concept of the “red carpet” is known today as it is.", "timestamp": 1794036002, "like_count": 60}, {"author": "lovefromify", "author_id": "7129663809", "id": "18098388092411257", "text": "Those gods can be so unfair.", "timestamp": 1794028684, "like_count": 115}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfauqFmq2X-/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfauqFmq2X-", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/890716898_18148180345570984_2426135578439390914_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyNDczNDQxOTM4Mzk2OTI3OA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=ZkEDgo-9XuMQ7kNvwH16OyJ&_nc_oc=Adrbs2KFDdr8zZAuVSNQam35sdWXvaxhKau2Opfe6u3RPYdlsBSzU4ZrDZJQL7rsEMrd4h10qOW-JF11r4ny14pr&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna&_nc_gid